{"id":"n63606-1-9","stage":1,"title":"지다 · 输","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63606-1-9-1","ko":"경기는 어떻게 되었어?","zh":"比赛结果怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"경기는","meaning":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","explanation":"경기：竞技，比赛，竞赛；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60094","senseId":"1","lemma":"경기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되었어?","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"13","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e56314e9a18b80c1","term":"경기","zh":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3","entryId":"60094","definition":"互相比较运动或技术等的能力。","pronunciation":["경ː기"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e197491d03e8cc29d088.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63606-1-9-2","ko":"우리 팀이 아깝게 져서 준우승을 하고 말았어.","zh":"我们队很可惜地输了，最终只获得了亚军。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"팀이","meaning":"组，小组，团队","explanation":"팀：组，小组，团队；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"팀","audio":"/audio/321639b7ad86dc7655c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20274","senseId":"1","lemma":"팀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아깝게","meaning":"可惜","explanation":"아깝다：可惜；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"아깝다","audio":"/audio/12194e98cc6edbd899e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24398","senseId":"3","lemma":"아깝다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"져서","meaning":"输","explanation":"지다：输；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63606","senseId":"1","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"준우승을","meaning":"亚军","explanation":"준우승：亚军；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"준우승","audio":"/audio/adbe7b40f813b032829f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76764","senseId":"1","lemma":"준우승","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하고","meaning":"获得；준우승을 하다 指获得亚军","explanation":"하다：获得；준우승을 하다 指获得亚军；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"8","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말았어.","meaning":"结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）","explanation":"말다：结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72580","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"321639b7ad86dc76","term":"팀","zh":"组，小组，团队","audio":"/audio/321639b7ad86dc7655c3.mp3","entryId":"20274","definition":"共事的一群人。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"12194e98cc6edbd8","term":"아깝다","zh":"可惜","audio":"/audio/12194e98cc6edbd899e3.mp3","entryId":"24398","definition":"没能好好发挥用途而感到惋惜。","pronunciation":["아깝따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"输","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"63606","definition":"在比赛或战争中败给对方。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"adbe7b40f813b032","term":"준우승","zh":"亚军","audio":"/audio/adbe7b40f813b032829f.mp3","entryId":"76764","definition":"在比赛中，占据冠军的次席；或指其等级。","pronunciation":["주ː누승"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"获得；준우승을 하다 指获得亚军","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"获得；준우승을 하다 指获得亚军","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"72580","definition":"结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6bd4b2b28c63d51ff3f8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.62,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=63606","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":33,"sequenceScore":1.4316,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["比赛结果怎么样？","我们队很可惜地输了，最终只获得了亚军。","原来你们是双胞胎，谁比较小？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["比赛结果怎么样？","我们队很可惜地输了，最终只获得了亚军。","原来你们是双胞胎，谁比较小？"],"answer":1}]}
